{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41892","headline":"题柴司徒亭假山 · 李中","name":"题柴司徒亭假山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叠石峨峨象翠微，远山魂梦便应稀。\n从教藓长添峰色，好引泉来作瀑飞。\n萤影夜攒疑烧起，茶烟朝出认云归。\n知君创得兹幽致，公退吟看到落晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}